   `!pp. (bvalf D (E:A->A->bool) B leq
          ((2 |-> t)((1 |-> m)(v:num->A))) pp) IN D /\
         E (bvalf D E B leq ((2 |-> t)((1 |-> m)(v:num->A))) pp) B`
